<title>NORWAY: Orkla 4-mnth pre-tax profits rise.</title>
<headline>Orkla 4-mnth pre-tax profits rise.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to April 30</p>
<p>				   (million of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Operating revenue	     9,419    vs    8,308</p>
<p> Operating result		  633    vs	514</p>
<p> Net financial items	    -154    vs     -230</p>
<p> Associated companies	     35    vs	 38</p>
<p> Portfolio gains		   419    vs	 371</p>
<p> Pre-tax result		    933    vs	 693</p>
<p> Tax and minorities	     -285    vs	-210</p>
<p> Net profit			  648    vs	 483</p>
<p> EPS (crowns)			13.50  vs	10.10</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Norwegian branded-goods based conglomerate is Orkla ASA. It was expected to post a pre-tax profit of 634 million crowns for the first four months, according to a consensus forecast by eight analysts polled by Reuters.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
